While there *is* an `index` form that takes two registers (`index <Zd>.<T>, <Rn>, <Rm>` where Rn is the base and Rm is the increment), the specific assembler being used (or its version) seems unable to resolve the ambiguity or doesn't support that specific encoding syntax directly in this manner.

